      "text": "ROOF LOAD\n  ↓\n  ROOF BEAM / JOIST → transfers to bearing wall\n  ↓\n  TOP BOND BEAM (reinforced CMU) — distributes concentrated loads\n  ↓\n  MASONRY WALL (compression in face shells and mortar joints)\n  ↓\n  FOOTING / FOUNDATION WALL\n  ↓\n  SOIL"
